  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med detta partnerskapsprogram &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka       handeln mellan Sverige och lndonesia samt bidra till utvecklingen av  SME&#xb4;s genom l&#xe5;ngsiktig, h&#xe5;llbar samverkan mellan akt&#xf6;rer,             n&#xe4;ringslivsorganisationer och f&#xf6;retag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective with this partnership programme is to enhance   trade between Sweden and lndonesia and to contribute to SMES&apos;         development throughlong-term sustainable collaboration between        actors, business organisations and companies.</narrative>
  </description>
